sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as Script
    participant D as Switch
    Note over S,D: RESTCONF: each edit is checked against the model, then applied to running
    S->>D: PATCH .../interface=GigabitEthernet1%2F0%2F3/config {"enabled": "no"}
    D-->>S: 400 invalid-value "for type boolean" (nothing applied)
    S->>D: PATCH same path {"description": "UNUSED", "enabled": false}
    D-->>S: 204 No Content (live now)
    Note over S,D: NETCONF: stage in candidate, then commit as one transaction
    S->>D: <lock> candidate
    S->>D: <edit-config> target candidate (many changes)
    S->>D: <validate> candidate
    alt all good
        S->>D: <commit> (optionally confirmed: auto-rollback if not confirmed)
        D-->>S: <ok/> candidate copied to running
    else something wrong
        S->>D: <discard-changes>
        D-->>S: <ok/> running never changed
    end
    S->>D: <unlock>
